Here is a clear breakdown of exactly how PDF.js styles each text span in the `TextLayer`.

---

## How PDF.js TextLayer Styles Text Spans

Source file: `/Users/daishokomiyama/Code/pdf-splitter/packages/web/node_modules/pdfjs-dist/build/pdf.mjs`, starting at line **11077** (`class TextLayer`) with `#appendText` at line **11243** and `#layout` at line **11316**.

