divStyle.left = `calc(var(--total-scale-factor) * ${left.toFixed(2)}px)`;
divStyle.top  = `calc(var(--total-scale-factor) * ${top.toFixed(2)}px)`;
```

---

### Step 3 — Set `font-size`

```js
