| CSS property | Source |
|---|---|
| `left` | `tx[4]` (translateX) ± ascent correction, as `%` of page width |
| `top` | `tx[5]` (translateY) − ascent, as `%` of page height |
| `font-size` | `Math.hypot(tx[2], tx[3])` (scale magnitude of the composed matrix) × `--total-scale-factor` CSS var |
